====Derived terms====
* {{l|ru|иври́тский}}

====Usage notes====
* Language names, which are nouns and not formed from adjectives and using the form "adjective + {{l|ru|язы́к|gloss=language}}" don't form adverbials of type "по-...ски" (e.g. по-англи́йски - in English), use {{l|ru|на}} + language name in the prepositional case instead, e.g. "(говорить/писать) на '''иври́те'''" - "to speak/write (in) Hebrew".

